	(text "TPS1H200AQDGNRQ1 Config.\nCL pin: current limit. Connect right to ground if un-used.\nElse, use resistor before connection to ground.\n    R_CL = (V_CL * K_CL) / I_out, V_CL = 0.8, K_CL = 2500\n    R_CL = (0.8 * 2500) / 0.5 = 4000 [Ohm]\nDELAY = set to auto-retry mode (connect w/ 100kOhm resistor to VS\n"
